WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.730
- Is it weird when you go--

00:00:01.730 --> 00:00:03.320
because we go to Disneyland
with some of our kids, right?

00:00:03.320 --> 00:00:04.153
- Yeah.

00:00:04.153 --> 00:00:05.190
- Your kids want to see the princesses--

00:00:05.190 --> 00:00:06.276
- Yeah.

00:00:06.276 --> 00:00:07.109
- Obviously, so, you know,

00:00:07.109 --> 00:00:08.890
what's it like, you running into you?

00:00:08.890 --> 00:00:11.010
- Well, let me start by saying,

00:00:11.010 --> 00:00:13.640
I'm a firm believer that
there is no ownership, right?

00:00:13.640 --> 00:00:15.480
- But there is the OG, but okay, cool.

00:00:15.480 --> 00:00:17.950
- Right, I'm OG Anna, for sure.

00:00:17.950 --> 00:00:20.220
But the one thing that's weird is that

00:00:20.220 --> 00:00:22.540
when you talk to them, you've
probably experienced this,

00:00:22.540 --> 00:00:23.645
they can't break.

00:00:23.645 --> 00:00:24.478
- (Kelly) No.

00:00:24.478 --> 00:00:25.910
- (Kristin) So, I go up,
and we're taking a picture,

00:00:25.910 --> 00:00:27.170
and I'm like, "Hi, how are you?"

00:00:27.170 --> 00:00:29.994
And she's like, "Arendelle
is beautiful today!"

00:00:29.994 --> 00:00:30.827
(audience laughs) (Kelly laughs and claps)

00:00:30.827 --> 00:00:33.280
- And I'm like, "Okay, she's...
alright, I'll ask Elsa."

00:00:33.280 --> 00:00:34.170
And I'm like, "How are you doing?"

00:00:34.170 --> 00:00:36.140
And she's like, "The ice has just melted,

00:00:36.140 --> 00:00:38.490
and Olaf is thrilled
with the summer weather."

00:00:38.490 --> 00:00:40.274
And I'm like, all I want to do is go,

00:00:40.274 --> 00:00:43.354
blink twice if you need to be rescued,

00:00:43.354 --> 00:00:46.110
because this is crazy. (audience laughs)

00:00:46.110 --> 00:00:48.566
- It's crazy to adults,
but the kids love it.

00:00:48.566 --> 00:00:50.850
- (Kristen) The kids
love it, but it is weird

00:00:50.850 --> 00:00:51.952
to the adults--

00:00:51.952 --> 00:00:52.785
- (Kelly) Yeah, yeah.

00:00:52.785 --> 00:00:54.220
- And they're doing this and stuff--

00:00:54.220 --> 00:00:55.400
- Yeah, and they laugh,

00:00:55.400 --> 00:00:56.843
like Snow White's my favorite, it's like

00:00:56.843 --> 00:00:58.320
(laughs cartoonishly)

00:00:58.320 --> 00:01:00.627
And I'm like, I'm just creeped out.

00:01:00.627 --> 00:01:02.667
- It's really, it's funny.

00:01:02.667 --> 00:01:03.770
- (Kelly) But my kids love it.

00:01:03.770 --> 00:01:05.220
- Oh the kids don't,
they don't see anything

00:01:05.220 --> 00:01:06.053
wrong with it.

00:01:06.053 --> 00:01:06.886
- (Kelly) Yeah, if they broke character,

00:01:06.886 --> 00:01:07.719
my kids would cry.

